%% Logical view: ReAct loop with pre-execution check and fact-carrying request shortcut
flowchart TB
    Request[Support Request]
    ReActAgent[ReAct Agent<br/>Reason Step]
    Decision{Need the lookup?}
    ToolCall[get_order_status<br/>Tool Call]
    Observation[Observation<br/>Tool Result]
    LoopBoundary[Loop Boundary<br/>MAX_STEPS=4<br/>Token Budget<br/>Wall-clock Budget]
    Reply[Reply]
    PreCheck[Pre-execution Check<br/>Allowlist + Schema]

    Request --> ReActAgent
    ReActAgent --> Decision
    Decision -- Facts present --> Reply
    Decision -- Facts missing --> ToolCall
    ToolCall --> PreCheck
    PreCheck -->|Allowed| Observation
    PreCheck -->|Denied| Reply
    Observation --> LoopBoundary
    LoopBoundary --> Decision
    LoopBoundary -->|Maxed| Reply

    style Request fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style Reply fill:#9f9,stroke:#333

